<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FNB proposes listing of Namibian unit.</title>
<headline>FNB proposes listing of Namibian unit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First National Bank Ltd (FNB) subsidiary Firstcorp Merchant Bank Ltd said on Tuesday a proposal was being considered to apply for a listing of the shares of FNB Namibia Ltd on the Namibian Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
